think Read REMEMBER (git nib b269554383, living edge HUNK83), the 1,024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat. Season A (Hardware & Right-to-Repair), parts-marketplace journey, is the live crux; HUNK83 landed the OR in the image layer and named its own next horizon: bring the OR to glass, mirroring HUNK79's AND-on-glass.
think Confirmed the custody gates in REMEMBER (force-push, provisioning, funds, real Kumara, deep debride, collaborator domain). This lap touches none — pure composition over public surfaces, a price clause compares a recorded cent count, no network/key/funds.
think Read the two models to mirror clause for clause: brushstroke/part_and_search.rye (HUNK79) and image/part_or.rye (HUNK83). part_or exposes parse_or / count_or / filter_or exactly as part_and exposes parse_and / count_and / filter_and, so the glass view is a faithful swap AND→OR.
think The one honest difference is the empty line: under AND it is a match-all drawing the whole catalog, under OR a match-none drawing a real empty page (the De Morgan dual). The selftest carries that dual rather than softening it.
think Chose a four-part bands fixture (bolt stainless 125c, nut brass 60c, gear acetal 845c, hexnut stainless 55c). Widening line material:stainless-304 max:60 keeps the union bolt/nut/hexnut (each once, held order) — three results, gear alone dropped. Bad offset 3 at rows=1 is past the three-part result.
